# A debugging session with a terminal in front of it, and the build that proves everything behind
# the seam needs no display library.
#
#     haxe debug.hxml
#
# Nothing reachable from here imports lime, and there is no display library on this classpath to
# import. If anything under hx68k.debug, hx68k.md, hx68k.cpu or hx68k.map ever grows a dependency
# on one, this build stops compiling, which is what makes the separation checkable rather than
# aspirational. hx68k.host is the only package allowed to know what a window is.

-cp src
-main hx68k.debug.DebugTool
-neko bin/debug.n
